{"seq":1,"slug":"build-and-tooling-for-agents","title":"Build And Tooling For Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tooling-as-the-agents-environment","title":"工具链是 Agent 的工作环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents/tooling-as-the-agents-environment","wordCount":1937,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"runnable-and-verifiable-projects","title":"可跑可验证的项目","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents/runnable-and-verifiable-projects","wordCount":1953,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"reproducible-environments","title":"可复现的环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/build-and-tooling-for-agents/reproducible-environments","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲清构建与工具链对 agent 的根本意义:工具链是 agent 的「工作环境」——它在这个环境里跑代码、验证改动,环境顺不顺直接决定它能不能工作;一个可跑可验证的项目(能跑起来、能自己验证改动对不对)是 agent 自我纠错的前提;而可复现的环境(在 agent、CI、每个人那里都一致地跑起来)避免了&quot;在我这跑不起来/结果不一样&quot;的混乱,是 agent 可靠工作的基础。</p>\n"}